# Git: local-root vs main (HARD — never confuse)

## Mental model (read this first)

| Location | Branch | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `d:\GHL_Montfort` (this Cursor workspace) | **always `local-root`** | Clone/layout only: full app + `reference/` + HTTrack + docs. **Not** GHL. **Not** production. |
| GitHub `main` | **`main` only** | What GHL AI Studio fetches via raw URLs. App paths at **repo root** (`src/`, `public/`, …). |

**`local-root` exists so we can clone the full tree.** Working here does **not** mean shipping to GHL. Shipping = copy **rewritten** app files into a **separate** `main` worktree and push that — **never** merge `local-root` ↔ `main`.

## This workspace is NEVER `main`

- Stay on `local-root`. Do **not** `git checkout main` in `d:\GHL_Montfort`.
- Do **not** merge `local-root` into `main` or `main` into `local-root`.
- Do **not** force-push `main`.
- When the user says “push / commit for GHL”, they mean **GitHub `main` with rewritten paths** — not dumping the whole local-root tree onto `main`.

## What goes to GitHub `main` (GHL only)

GHL fetches: `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/FerozArshad/montfortre/main/<path>`

Push **only** new/updated files under `ghl-react/`, paths **rewritten to repo root** (no `ghl-react/` prefix):

| Local working tree (`local-root`) | Path on GitHub `main` |
|---|---|
| `ghl-react/src/...` | `src/...` |
| `ghl-react/public/...` | `public/...` |
| `ghl-react/index.html` | `index.html` |
| `ghl-react/package.json` | `package.json` (only if the app needed a package change) |
| `ghl-react/DOCUMENTATION.md` | `DOCUMENTATION.md` |
| `ghl-react/GHL-PASTE-TO-STUDIO.md` | `GHL-PASTE-TO-STUDIO.md` |
| `ghl-react/GHL-TRANSFER-TRACKING.md` | `GHL-TRANSFER-TRACKING.md` |
| `ghl-react/GHL-URLS.md` | `GHL-URLS.md` |
| `ghl-react/seo-audit/...` | `seo-audit/...` |

When listing files for the user / GHL paste, use **main paths only** (e.g. `src/pages/Foo.tsx`), never `ghl-react/src/...`.

## Never push to `main`

- `reference/` (HTTrack, CDN captures)
- `.cursor/`
- Anything that exists only on the local-root parent layout
- `ghl-react/package-lock.json` unless the user explicitly asks
- The `ghl-react/` folder prefix itself

## Required ship workflow

1. Implement on `local-root` under `ghl-react/`.
2. Optionally commit + `git push origin local-root` (backup of the clone layout).
3. `git fetch origin main` (fetch refspec tracks `local-root` only).
4. Add a **separate** worktree from `FETCH_HEAD`, e.g. `D:\GHL_Montfort_main_pushN`.
5. Copy rewritten files into that worktree; commit on `feature/<name>-ghl`.
6. `git push -u origin HEAD` then **fast-forward** `git push origin HEAD:main` (not force).
7. Do **not** merge branches between `local-root` and `main`.

Next unused main worktree after `push12`: **`D:\GHL_Montfort_main_push13`**.
